<title>USA: SunGard Data completes GMI Software buy.</title>
<headline>SunGard Data completes GMI Software buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunGard Data Systems Inc said Friday its SunGard Futures Systems unit completed its previously announced acquisition of GMI Software Inc in a stock agreement valued at $30 million.</p>
<p>The company said the deal creates an entity that provides financial software to the exchange-traded derivatives market.</p>
<p>The deal is not expected to have a material impact on SunGard's financial results in 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>SunGard provides computer service and application software.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 1/4 Friday at 39-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
